WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.710
I am ready for dessert.

2
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.140
I want the giant sundae.

3
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.800
Wow, that bowl is bigger than your head, Tom!

4
00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.290
It is not healthy.

5
00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:23.750
But it is tastier than a plain fruit salad.

6
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.660
Look at the price, too.

7
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:29.440
The sundae is more expensive than the cake.

8
00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.910
That is okay.

9
00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.320
It is a special day.

10
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:35.710
My love for sundaes is stronger than my diet!

11
00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:39.750
Fine, I’ll have the giant sundae too.

12
00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:50.240
Sarah, look at this black laptop.

13
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.990
It is cheaper than the silver one.

14
00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.870
Yes, but it is very heavy.

15
00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:59.710
The silver laptop is lighter than the black one.

16
00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:00.670
You’re right.

17
00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:03.170
It is also smaller than my old laptop.

18
00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:07.460
It is much better than your old one, Tom.

19
00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:10.850
Your old laptop is too slow!

20
00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:13.090
Okay, let’s buy the silver one.

21
00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.910
It is faster than the black laptop

22
00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.970
We need to choose a car for our road trip.

23
00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.370
This red car is huge!

24
00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:31.290
I like it.

25
00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:32.870
It is bigger than the blue car.

26
00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.910
We have a lot of bags.

27
00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.390
But the blue car is cheaper than the red one.

28
00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:41.720
Gas is very expensive right now.

29
00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:46.970
True, but the red car is safer than the small one for long drives.

30
00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:50.040
Okay, but you are driving.

31
00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.690
Driving it is harder than driving a small car!

32
00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:56.440
Don’t worry, I am a good driver.
